  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following set is having correct statements here regarding both B and Al?<br />\r<math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math> They combine with nitrogen to form nitrides<br />\r<math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo></math> They react with HCl to form chlorides<br />\r<math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math> They burn in oxygen to give oxides at high temperature<br />\r<math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Their halides are Lewis acids"
  },
  "options": [
